       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COMPOUNDINTEREST.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PRINCIPAL   PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 1000.00.
       01 RATE        PIC 9V9999 VALUE 0.0525.
       01 BALANCE     PIC 9(9)V99.
       01 INTEREST    PIC 9(7)V99.
       01 YEAR-NO     PIC 99.
       01 BAL-EDIT    PIC $$,$$$,$$9.99.
       01 INT-EDIT    PIC $$,$$$,$$9.99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE PRINCIPAL TO BALANCE
           PERFORM VARYING YEAR-NO FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL YEAR-NO > 5
               COMPUTE INTEREST ROUNDED = BALANCE * RATE
               ADD INTEREST TO BALANCE
               MOVE INTEREST TO INT-EDIT
               MOVE BALANCE TO BAL-EDIT
               DISPLAY "YEAR " YEAR-NO " INTEREST " INT-EDIT
                       " BALANCE " BAL-EDIT
           END-PERFORM
           STOP RUN.
